      "grammarFocus": "accusative with на",
      "sentenceRef": "Кандидат на позицию младшего аналитика.",
      "explanation": "When 'на' indicates direction or purpose (answering 'куда?' or 'на что?'), it takes accusative case. 'На позицию' = 'for the position.' Compare: 'на позиции' (prepositional, location — at the position) vs. 'на позицию' (accusative, direction — for the position). Similarly: 'на работу' (to work) vs. 'на работе' (at work).",
      "focusArea": "cases"
    },
