      "sentenceRef": "Не хватает опыта.",
      "explanation": "'Не хватает' (not enough, lacking) always requires genitive case for what is missing: 'не хватает опыта' (lacking experience), 'не хватает времени' (not enough time), 'не хватает денег' (not enough money). The person who lacks something goes in dative: 'Ей не хватает опыта' (She lacks experience). It's an impersonal construction with no nominative subject.",
      "focusArea": "cases"
